<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s345S">The answer is that there is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w4">no</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w3">occurrence</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w2">this</span> stage <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s345p1">for</span> such a person. In the first place, the stage <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s345f7">cannot occur</span> before the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w5">victim</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w6">dies</span>; in the second place, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s345p12">where</span> the murderer <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w11">dies</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w10">at the same time</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s345p9">as</span> his <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w8">victim</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w14">another</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w13">body</span> of the killer has been <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w15">born</span>. There is no actual commission <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s345p20">because</span> the body <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s345p18">never</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w19">went through</span> the stage of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w17">undertaking</span> this act towards the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s345w16">victim</span> in question.</span>
</div>
